  "features": [
    "Give your iPhone 17 Pro or 17 Pro Max the protection it deserves—without hiding its original look. This premium case features a solid aluminium body frame with a crystal-clear transparent center, offering a perfect fit that highlights the natural design of your device. The sleek metal bumper adds durability and style, while the transparent back maintains the iconic look of the iPhone 17 series ✨ Key Features"
  ],
  "description_text": "Give your iPhone 17 Pro or 17 Pro Max the protection it deserves—without hiding its original look. This premium case features a solid aluminium body frame with a crystal-clear transparent center, offering a perfect fit that highlights the natural design of your device. The sleek metal bumper adds durability and style, while the transparent back maintains the iconic look of the iPhone 17 series ✨ Key Features • Premium Aluminium Body Frame – Strong, durable, and stylish • Transparent Middle Back – Keeps the original iPhone 17 Pro/Pro Max design visible • Perfect Fit – Designed exclusively for iPhone 17 Pro & 17 Pro Max • Sleek & Lightweight – Protection without bulk • Raised Camera Protection – Prevents scratches on lens • Anti-Slip Grip – Comfortable and secure to hold 📱 Compatibility • iPhone 17 Pro • iPhone 17 Pro Max",
  "description_html": "<p>Give your iPhone 17 Pro or 17 Pro Max the protection it deserves—without hiding its original look.</p>\n<p>This premium case features a solid aluminium body frame with a crystal-clear transparent center, offering a perfect fit that highlights the natural design of your device.</p>\n<p>The sleek metal bumper adds durability and style, while the transparent back maintains the iconic look of the iPhone 17 series</p>\n<p>✨ Key Features<br> • Premium Aluminium Body Frame – Strong, durable, and stylish<br> • Transparent Middle Back – Keeps the original iPhone 17 Pro/Pro Max design visible<br> • Perfect Fit – Designed exclusively for iPhone 17 Pro &amp; 17 Pro Max<br> • Sleek &amp; Lightweight – Protection without bulk<br> • Raised Camera Protection – Prevents scratches on lens<br> • Anti-Slip Grip – Comfortable and secure to hold</p>\n<p>📱 Compatibility<br> • iPhone 17 Pro<br> • iPhone 17 Pro Max</p>"
